{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04550","headline":"夕宴房主簿舍 · 张说","name":"夕宴房主簿舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁晏关雍空，风急河谓冰。\n薄游羁物役，微尚惬远凭。\n旅馆月宿永，闭扃云思兴。\n伊人美修夜，朋酒惠来称。\n交谈既清雅，琴吹亦凄凝。\n不逢君蹇涸，幽意长郁蒸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}